    <string name="air_source_help">Air Modes Explained:\n
        - Disable: No Air detection.\n
        - Gyro: Tilt phone to change Air height.\n
        - Accel: Vertical shake triggers Air.\n
        - Touch: Top screen area triggers Air.\n
        - Camera: Front camera tracks hand height.\n
        - Proximity: Hover hand over the earpiece to trigger Air.\n
        - Light: Block the light sensor (usually near earpiece).\n
        - Auto: Air active when any key touched.</string>

